sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant L as Lovelace
  participant C as SolarEnergyGraphsCard
  participant H as home-assistant-energy-history
  participant WS as HA WebSocket
  participant R as EnergyChartsRenderer

  L->>C: setConfig(config)
  Note over C: each of the 4 roles: entity ID or null<br/>reset model, bump historyRequestId
  L->>C: set hass(hass)
  C->>C: loadHistoryWhenNeeded()
  Note over C: loadKey = timeZone:day:entities<br/>same key -> nothing to do
  C->>H: getEnergyUnitScales(sensor attributes)
  H-->>C: W or kW factor per sensor (or error)
  par fetchHistory -- Promise.allSettled
    C->>WS: statistics 5minute + hour
    WS-->>C: mean / min / max rows
  and today only
    C->>WS: history, last 15 min
    WS-->>C: compressed raw states
  and precision probe
    C->>WS: history, minute before the same time of day
    WS-->>C: compressed raw states
  end
  Note over C: response dropped if historyRequestId changed<br/>probe finer than statistics -> precision button shown
  C->>H: combineStatistics, parseCompressedPowerSamples,<br/>replaceSensorHistory
  C->>H: projectEnergyHistory(samples, window, now, statistics)
  H-->>C: EnergyHistoryResponse
  alt first data
    C->>R: new EnergyChartsRenderer(containers, data)
  else charts exist
    C->>R: updateData(data)
  end
  L->>C: disconnectedCallback()
  C->>R: destroy()
  Note over C: timers cancelled, pending requests ignored
